('Caterpillar','20R-7549','Cat Reman Camshaft Kit 3406C','Cat Reman camshaft kit for 3406C; includes camshaft and Cat Reman valve lifters as described by Caterpillar.',ARRAY['3406C']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/20R-7549','Listed in the complete public Cat Camshaft Kits category (1–7 of 7). Official product page: Recommended Application 3406C; Compatible Models lists Truck Engine 3406C.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3406C']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','0R-3021','Cat Reman Camshaft Kit 3208','Cat Reman camshaft kit; official product page gives Recommended Application 3208 NA and describes the kit as a camshaft with Cat Reman valve lifters.',ARRAY['3208','3208 NA']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-3021','Listed in the complete public Cat Camshaft Kits category (1–7 of 7). Official product page lists Recommended Application 3208 NA and compatible 3208 engine applications plus CS-553, CS-551, CP-553, CB-614, PS-500, 227, 229, 225 and 225B.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3208','CS-553','CS-551','CP-553','CB-614','PS-500','227','229','225','225B']::text[]),
