('Caterpillar','20R-7547','Cat Reman Camshaft Kit 3406B','Cat Reman camshaft kit for 3406B; includes camshaft and Cat Reman valve lifters as described by Caterpillar.',ARRAY['3406B']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/20R-7547','Listed in the complete public Cat Camshaft Kits category (1–7 of 7). Official product page lists Recommended Application 3406B and Compatible Models Truck Engine 3406C/3406B and Industrial Engine 3406B.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3406B','3406C']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','20R-7555','Cat Reman Camshaft Kit 3408','Cat Reman camshaft kit for 3408; Cat Parts Store category listing explicitly identifies the 3408 application.',ARRAY['3408']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/20R-7555','Listed in the complete public Cat Camshaft Kits category (1–7 of 7). The official category listing identifies Cat Reman Camshaft Kit (3408); compatible-model detail was not available in the retrieved product page and is left empty.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY[]::text[]),
